  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nutrition Action for Systemic Change</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The programme contributes to preventing and reducing malnutrition in all its forms with a particular focus on tackling undernutrition and improving diets of women, girls and children. It will do so by strengthening policy and accountability at country and global level so that health, food and other systems more effectively integrate nutrition objectives, increased public finance is mobilised for delivering nutrition services, and sustainable, healthy diets become more affordable and accessible.</narrative>
  </description>
